      "message": "I don\u0027t know, just always assumed it\u0027s not possible :-S I know that support for input attachments that are not one of the color/depth/stencil attachments was unintended in Vulkan, but I guess it\u0027s there and working. Given MSRTSS is older than DRLR, please make sure this path is actually tested by forcing MSRTSS off.",
