      "writtenOn": "2026-02-12T12:56:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/latest/html/vkspec.html#_non_overlapping_access_between_resources supports your point, thanks for the detailed answer. So it seems that we need DRLR :/ which has only very little support even on Android.",
      "parentUuid": "a66087c6_06d1eb0c",
      "revId": "abbcbf94a1d3e9ee8c789632f83b931a13d37c1e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a32c59cd_5b9a92c2",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/vulkan/ResolveTextureLoadingUtilsVk.cpp",
