      "writtenOn": "2026-02-08T14:38:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Input attachment aren\u0027t read past this in the render pass, so I\u0027m curious why this was needed instead of having both `src/dstAccessMask` be `VK_ACCESS_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_WRITE_BIT`.",
      "revId": "abbcbf94a1d3e9ee8c789632f83b931a13d37c1e",
