      "writtenOn": "2026-02-08T14:38:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ditto, both can be `VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_OUTPUT_BIT`? What we want is to make sure all color outputs prior happen before all color outputs after.\n\nActually that should be guaranteed by the API, so we might not even need a barrier.",
      "revId": "abbcbf94a1d3e9ee8c789632f83b931a13d37c1e",
